# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  .gitignore — Equipment Checklist
#  Keeps secrets, local databases and build output out of source control.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

## ── Build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.swp
*.bak
*.orig

## ── Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code ────────────────────────────────
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sln.docstates
*.lock.json
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

## ── ASP.NET runtime / secrets ──────────────────────────────────────
# Offline-voucher RSA private signing key (generated on first run).
# NEVER commit — anyone with this key can mint valid vouchers.
App_Data/voucher_rsa.pem
App_Data/*.pem
App_Data/*.key

# User secrets (referenced via UserSecretsId in the .csproj)
secrets.json

# Local SQLite cache used by the offline pipeline
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
digitalChecklist_offline.db

# wwwroot files generated at runtime (icon library uploads, item images,
# signature renders). Keep the folders, drop the contents.
wwwroot/icon-library/*
!wwwroot/icon-library/.gitkeep
wwwroot/item-images/*
!wwwroot/item-images/.gitkeep
wwwroot/uploads/*
!wwwroot/uploads/.gitkeep

## ── .NET MAUI mobile project (when it's scaffolded) ────────────────
EquipmentChecklist.Mobile/[Bb]in/
EquipmentChecklist.Mobile/[Oo]bj/
EquipmentChecklist.Mobile/*.binlog

# Platform secrets that the MAUI tooling can drop next to the project
*.p12
*.pfx
*.cer
*.keystore
*.jks
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist

## ── Log files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/

## ── OS scratch ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
